{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453420/extras/WishlistFollowGif.gif?t=1740245608\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453420/extras/GameplayGif.gif?t=1740245608\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shroud of Gloom</strong> combines the charm and nostalgia of classic point-and-click games with a chilling horror atmosphere. Solve puzzles, collect items and uncover secrets with nothing but a flickering flashlight to guide your way. Can you escape the dark and make it out alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453420/extras/IntroGif.gif?t=1740245608\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Point-and-Click Gameplay:</strong> Classic and intuitive controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Engaging Puzzles:</strong> Solve a variety of puzzles and uncover mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric Horror:</strong> Explore a dark and dangerous environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defenseless Survival:</strong> The best strategy is to remain undetected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Inventory System:</strong> Find and collect useful items to aid your escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Monochrome Pixel Art:</strong> Distinctive and minimalistic visuals.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3453420?t=1740245608","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453420/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740245608","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453420/bde527f6ee9ebc2ee90ab205c05e7ed390ffdd12/capsule_231x87.j